<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Raven</title>

    ```
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7f6;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e2ebe6;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            color: #007a55;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #101b18;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .success-box {
            background: #f0f7f3;
            border: 1px solid #d5e8df;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            color: #007a55;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5eee9;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9aaa9f;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
    ```

</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">

        ```
        <div class="logo">
            RAVEN
        </div>

        <h2>
            Congratulations, <%= name %>! 🎉
        </h2>

        <p>
            We're excited to inform you that you have been officially
            selected to join <strong>Raven</strong> as a developer.
        </p>

        <div class="success-box">
            Welcome to the Raven team!
        </div>

        <p>
            Your application has been successfully reviewed, and we are
            pleased to welcome you to our development team.
        </p>

        <p>
            We look forward to working with you, building meaningful
            products, and creating something remarkable together.
        </p>

        <p>
            Further information about your onboarding and next steps
            will be shared with you soon.
        </p>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Raven. All rights reserved.
                <br />
                See what's next. Build what matters.
        </div>

    </div>
    ```

</body>

</html>